OL,3,GNEWSANine-day Brighton Main Line
OL,4,Aclosure warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Brighton Main Line, one of the
OL,7,Fbusiest stretches of railway in the UK,
OL,8,Fis set to be closed for nine days in
OL,9,FFebruary, operator Greater Thameslink
OL,10,FRailway (GTR) has said.
OL,12,FAll lines south of Three Bridges will
OL,13,Fbe closed over the half-term period
OL,14,Ffrom 13 February until 21 February
OL,15,Finclusive, with buses running in place
OL,16,Fof trains.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
