OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSANine-day Brighton Main Line
OL,4,Aclosure warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FGTR said the work was to improve the
OL,7,Freliability and safety of the vital
OL,8,Froute with "significant investment",
OL,9,Fwith works including track renewal,
OL,10,Fearthworks and renewal of level
OL,11,Fcrossings.
OL,13,FThe line to London through Horsham,
OL,14,FBognor Regis and Portsmouth remains
OL,15,Fopen, while trains towards London,
OL,16,FBedford and Cambridge will start and
OL,17,Fterminate at Three Bridges.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
